# Patient clinical UI — simple style

- **White cards**, light grey borders `#e5e7eb`, minimal shadow
- **Blue** `#2563eb` for selected/documented teeth and active tabs
- **Light blue fill** `#dbeafe` for teeth with notes
- **Sans-serif only** — no serif eyebrows or gold accents on clinical charts
- **Two-column layout**: odontogram left, tooth record panel right
- **Service toggle**: Medical / Cosmetic pill switch at top of Medical Record tab
- Notes edit on the **right panel**, not floating on the chart
